# The bytes: 2f='/' 6c='l' 69='i' 62='b' 36='6' 34='4' 2f='/' 6c='l'
# All shown as hex "2f 6c 69 62 36 34 2f 6c"

# So ALL bytes outside the magic are shown as hex
# The magic bytes (ELF) that are printable get &nbsp; treatment

# Now I have enough to start writing the code. Let me begin.
